[5381.167959, "o", "FooterSize = 32\r\n    19\t)\r\n    20\t\r\n    21\ttype Dtype uint8\r\n    22\t\r\n    23\tconst (\r\n    24\t\tFloat32 Dtype = 0\r\n    25\t\tFloat64 Dtype = 1\r\n    26\t\tInt32   Dtype = 2\r\n    27\t\tInt64   Dtype = 3\r\n    28\t)\r\n    29\t\r\n    30\tfunc (d Dtype) Valid() bool {\r\n    31\t\treturn d == Float32 || d == Float64 || d == Int32 || d == Int64\r\n    32\t}\r\n    33\t\r\n"]
